Regularization and CNN (EX4)

Python implementations of regularized logistic regression using gradient
descent and a convolutional neural network (CNN) trained on CIFAR-10.

Code Modules:
- gradient_descent.py: Gradient descent optimizer used for training.
- learning_rate.py: Learning rate schedule implementations.
- modules.py: L1, L2, LogisticModule, and RegularizedModule components.
- logistic_regression.py: LogisticRegression estimator with L1/L2 penalties.
- regularization_main.py: ROC analysis and L1/L2 regularization experiments
  on South Africa heart disease data.
- train_cifar_cnn.py: PyTorch CNN architecture, training, and evaluation
  on CIFAR-10.
